  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 3ea90144ef4ac7a4699131a7438e0496, type: 3}
  m_Name: B10 how
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueStateSO
  <Texts>k__BackingField:
  - <Text>k__BackingField: <color=#FF99DD>I summoned you, of course! I looked out
      for the purest soul my gaze could scrutinize, the one most worthy enough to
      assist me in my quest of purging the world from the new gods' influence. And
      I finally found you.
    TextAlignment: 260
  - <Text>k__BackingField: <color=#99DDFF>I-I'm sorry, I don't see what you've found
      in me... I just bought a statuette that just looked like you...
    TextAlignment: 260
  - <Text>k__BackingField: <color=#FF99DD>Yes, one of my very few remaining eyes
      and ears in your plane. But do not berate your validity, little one. I sense
      great potential in you.
    TextAlignment: 260
  - <Text>k__BackingField: Her three pairs of eyes suddenly lock deep in your own,
      and you feel a bit ill at ease with her insistant gaze drilling into your head.
    TextAlignment: 257
  - <Text>k__BackingField: <color=#FF99DD>Yes, I see... A crushing obligation, day
      to day, to be a part of the cabale the new gods laid for your kind. An obligation
      that leaves you drained of your energy and will and leaves you purposeless
      in life.
    TextAlignment: 260
  - <Text>k__BackingField: <color=#FF99DD>I see... A lost love, that you cannot help
      but remininsce over every waking moment of your life. A missed opportunity
      that will probably never come back.
    TextAlignment: 260
  - <Text>k__BackingField: 'She must have been sensing my discomfort at her words,
      as she nudges me with the tip of her muzzle, and tries to bring back some comfort
      with her angelic voice:'
    TextAlignment: 257
  - <Text>k__BackingField: <color=#FF99DD>As I said, be not afraid. All your worries
      will be gone soon enough. You are with me now, after all.
    TextAlignment: 257
  <Illustration>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
  <Bgm>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
  <SFX>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
  <Item>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
  <Branches>k__BackingField:
  - Text: '- "What happened to your cult?"'
    Next: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2556c021282d1cf45a00cf7ba38188fc, type: 2}
  - Text: '- "What is this place?"'
    Next: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ed77ef69b09794d458a8f23e5a7d6021, type: 2}
  - Text: '- "You mentioned a ''reward''?"'
    Next: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1b974c4d9270ee440b4c5f6df71809ba, type: 2}
  - Text: '- "I have no more questions."'
    Next: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 310c89589aaf2b247af5a8ee27aff595, type: 2}
